u-p0117","role":"扬州刺史同成阵","evidence":["santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0123","role":"领丹杨锐卒刀盾五千号青巾兵、三冲不动退引乱","evidence":["santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0129","role":"因乱乘之","evidence":["santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb"]},{"person":"wgc-p0019","role":"同乘之","evidence":["santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0127","role":"又出其后","evidence":["santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0110","role":"版桥被获","evidence":["santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0126","role":"同被获","evidence":["santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb","source_order":[48,46,169],"order":8909}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0127","name":"张乔","evidence":["santizhu-q-ecd7e1ee0fc79697a0d8","santizhu-q-63dbb0fc9a075bddc66d","santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4311ae30072f04acbaa0","layer":"pei","quote":"与讨吴护军张翰、扬州刺史周浚成阵相对。沈莹领丹杨锐卒刀盾五千，号曰‘青巾兵’，前后屡陷坚阵：于是以驰淮南军，三冲不动；退引，乱。薛胜、蒋班，因其乱而乘之，吴军以次土崩，将帅不能止；张乔又出其后：大败吴军于版桥，获悌、震、莹等","attribution":"裴注·干宝《晋纪》","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":548,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":169,"end":281},{"id":"santizhu-q-63dbb0fc9a075bddc66d","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4311ae30072f04acbaa0","layer":"pei","quote":"吴副军师诸葛靓，欲屠之，悌曰：‘敌在前，不宜先事其小；且杀降不祥。’靓曰：‘此等以救兵未至而力少，故且伪降以缓我；非来伏也。因其无战心而尽坑之，可以成三军之气。若舍之而前，必为后患！’悌不从，抚之而进","attribution":"裴注·干宝《晋纪》","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":548,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":68,"end":168},{"id":"santizhu-q-ecd7e1ee0fc79697a0d8","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4311ae30072f04acbaa0","layer":"pei","quote":"吴丞相、军师张悌，护军孙震，丹杨太守沈莹，帅众三万济江，围成阳都尉张乔于杨荷桥；众才七千，闭栅自守，举白接告降","attribution":"裴注·干宝《晋纪》","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":548,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":12,"end":67}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
